# Verboten Spirits

> An independent South African brandy house in Silverton, Pretoria. Founded in
> 2020. Premium brandy and a canned brandy and cola, plus the other bottles
> listed below. Sold online and delivered anywhere in South Africa, and poured
> from the house's own mobile bar at events in Gauteng.
> Tagline: Pure Spirit. Pure Mischief. Also used: "Vir dié wat weet"
> (Afrikaans for "for those who know") and "Born in Pretoria. Made for the world."

Verboten is German for forbidden. The house line is "Some rules are meant to
be questioned": the brand is playful about convention and strict about age.

## Products

- [Verboten Premium Brandy](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-premium-brandy): R450. 750ml, 43% ABV, aged 3 years, finished in french oak casks. A three year South African brandy, finished in French oak casks. Born in Pretoria, made for the world.
- [Verboten Brandy & Cola](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-brandy-cola): R45. 440ml, 5% ABV. The same spirit with its collar loosened, pre-mixed in a 440ml can. Cold, easy, and unmistakably South African.
- [Verboten Premium Set, 2 Bottles](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-premium-set-2-bottle): R850. Two bottles of Verboten Premium Brandy for R850, fifty rand under buying them one at a time.
- [Verboten NYX](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-nyx): R250. 750ml, 43% ABV. Liquorice and anise in the Greek style. Very cold and neat, or long with cola.
- [Verboten Blood Orange Gin](https://verboten.co.za/shop/verboten-blood-orange-gin): R250. 750ml. Blood orange gin, 750ml. Bright at the front, bitter at the edge, dry where it counts.

Delivery is R150 flat anywhere in South Africa, free from R2 500. Ships within 1 to 2 weeks

